msgstr "Li fitchî afitcha shonne esse cron. Dji n' a savou drovi l' documint."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:223
msgid ""
"This document contains an unknown checksum. When you give a password it "
"might not be verified."
msgstr ""
"I gn a dins c' documint ci ene checksum nén cnoxhowe. Cwand vs denroz on "
"scret, i pôrè esse verifyî."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:249 odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:266
msgid ""
"This document contains an unknown encryption method. Some parts may be "
"unreadable."
msgstr ""
"I gn a dins c' documint ci ene metôde d' ecriptaedje nén cnoxhowe. Des "
"bokets pôrént esse nén léjhåve."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:281
msgid ""
"This document contains incomplete encryption data. Some parts may be "
"unreadable."
msgstr ""
"I gn a dins c' documint ci des dnêyes d' ecriptaedje nén completes. Des "
"bokets pôrént esse nén léjhåve."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:295
msgid ""
"QCA has currently no support for SHA1 or PBKDF2 using SHA1. The document can "
"not be opened."
msgstr ""
"Ig n a pol moumint pont d' sopoirt dins QCA po SHA1 ou PBKDF2 s' siervant d' "
"SHA1. Dji n' sai drovi l' documint."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:326
msgid ""
"The manifest file seems to be corrupted. It cannot be modified and the "
"document will remain unreadable. Please try and save the document again to "
"prevent losing your work."
msgstr ""
"Li fitchî afitcha shonne esse cron. Dji n' sai l' candjî eyet l' documint "
"dmorrè nén léjhåve. Sayîz s' i vs plait co on côp d' schaper l' documint po "
"n' nén piede vost ovraedje."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:424
msgid ""
"The manifest file cannot be written. The document will remain unreadable. "
"Please try and save the document again to prevent losing your work."
msgstr ""
"Dji n' sai scrire sol fitchî afitcha. Li documint dmorrè nén léjhåve. Sayîz "
"s' i vs plait co on côp d' schaper l' documint po n' nén piede vost ovraedje."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:533
msgid "Please enter the password to open this file."
msgstr "Dinez l' sicret po drovi c' fitchî, s' i vs plait."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:706
msgid "Please enter the password to encrypt the document with."
msgstr "Dinez l' sicret pos ecripter l' fitchî."

#: odf/KoEncryptedStore.cpp:720
